  "notes": "FORMATION:\n{査|さ} (inspect, examine) + {読|どく} (read) → reading to examine\n\nVERB FORM:\n{査読|さどく}する (to peer review)\n\nACADEMIC TERMS:\n- {査読|さどく}{者|しゃ} (peer reviewer)\n- {査読|さどく}{付|つ}き{論文|ろんぶん} (peer-reviewed paper)\n- {査読|さどく}{付|つ}き{雑誌|ざっし} (peer-reviewed journal)\n- {査読|さどく}{過程|かてい} (peer review process)\n\nPROCESS:\n{投稿|とうこう} (submission) → {査読|さどく} (peer review) → {採用|さいよう}/{不採用|ふさいよう} (acceptance/rejection)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {審査|しんさ} (examination, screening)\n- {校閲|こうえつ} (proofreading)",
